docs {
  # Delete Savings Transaction (`DeleteSavingsTransaction`)

  **Route**: `DELETE /api/_private/v1/savings-accounts/:id/transactions/:txnId` (Bearer token required)

  Soft deletes a savings transaction. The calculated account balance updates accordingly.
